ARTICLE_HTML = '''<p>Both treatments lift and tighten without surgery, and both are available at Da Vinci Clinic. The difference is the energy they use and the layer they are best at reaching. Here is how our doctors decide between them at consultation.</p>
<h2>What XERF is</h2><p>XERF is Cynosure Lutronic’s dual-frequency monopolar radiofrequency platform, the first to deliver 6.78 MHz and 2 MHz in a single shot. The 6.78 MHz frequency concentrates energy in the more superficial layers for firmness, texture and fine lines; the 2 MHz frequency reaches deeper tissue for jowls, jawline definition and laxity. It has three adjustable depth levels, ten intensity settings, integrated cryogen cooling, and needs no needles, no numbing cream and no downtime.</p>
<h2>What Ultherapy Prime is</h2><p>Ultherapy Prime is micro-focused ultrasound with real-time DeepSEE imaging. The doctor sees the tissue layer before energy is delivered, which is why it is the only FDA-cleared non-invasive procedure to lift the neck, chin and brow. Treatment takes 60 to 90 minutes with numbing cream, results develop over two to three months and last about 12 to 18 months. Da Vinci is recognised as Malaysia’s top Ultherapy Prime user.</p>
<h2>How to choose</h2><table><tr><th>Feature</th><th>XERF</th><th>Ultherapy Prime</th></tr><tr><td>Energy</td><td>Dual-frequency radiofrequency</td><td>Micro-focused ultrasound</td></tr><tr><td>Best at</td><td>Tightening the dermis, texture, mild to moderate laxity</td><td>Lifting the deep support layer, brow, neck and jowls</td></tr><tr><td>Numbing cream</td><td>Not required</td><td>Applied</td></tr><tr><td>Downtime</td><td>None</td><td>Mild redness</td></tr><tr><td>Results last</td><td>Develops over weeks; sessions planned by your doctor</td><td>About 12 to 18 months</td></tr></table>
<h3>When our doctors lean towards XERF</h3><ul><li>Early laxity, maintenance, or a preference for no numbing and no downtime</li><li>Skin texture, crepiness and fine lines across a wide area</li><li>Patients who want a comfortable, cooled session</li></ul>
<h3>When our doctors lean towards Ultherapy Prime</h3><ul><li>A visible brow, jowl or neck lift is the goal</li><li>The doctor wants to see the tissue plane before treating</li><li>Longer-lasting single-session results are the priority</li></ul>
<p>Many patients combine both within the DV™ SynergyLift protocol: Ultherapy Prime for the lift, radiofrequency for the surface. The consultation decides. Book at any of our four Kuala Lumpur clinics.</p>'''
